			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 10, DX 12, IQ 3, HT 14, HP 14, WILL 3, PER 11, FP 14, SPEED 6.5, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 1. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nKqIpqBzdLFPdULF0",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 15 (offense 11, protection 4), threat tier minor, appearing 6."
		},
		{
			"id": "nCFnrcuIFBjPzcgfQ",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/fiendish-dire-rat.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nnM-tIV1Kl46POZ0z",
			"text": "Independent build total: 36 points of racial traits plus 10 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nexoOh0S8xwlb2B62",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Fiendish Creature (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "n1qum1Pga-MrnIWoj",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nAGqesVt0sRuy8OUR",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 25 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nBB36ybUbgCXYK04S",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "n2KFDGnoVDUK98PhK",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nodu2umjSvd0uxyYt",
			"text": "The base animal is the library's Dire Rat; the fiendish touch adds dark vision, a little resistance to magic, and fire and cold resistance bought as limited Damage Resistance."
		},
		{
			"id": "nkHwzVpa_OeBbfXf2",
			"text": "It answers the SRD's Fiendish Creature template heading as that page's own printed exemplar."
		},
		{
			"id": "n_LOmelSir7S82Skx",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
